<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<!-- About Hero -->
<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>The story behind every sparkle</p>
    <nav class="breadcrumbs">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="separator"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i></span>
      <span class="current">About</span>
    </nav>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Our Story -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/images/products/set-bridal-gold-1.jpeg" alt="Our Jewelry Workshop">
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>Jewels by Iram was born from a passion for exquisite craftsmanship and timeless elegance. What started as a small family venture has blossomed into a beloved jewelry brand, known for creating pieces that celebrate the beauty and grace of every woman.</p>
        <p>Each piece in our collection tells a story — of skilled artisans who pour their hearts into every design, of precious materials sourced with care, and of traditions that inspire modern elegance. We believe jewelry is more than adornment; it's an expression of who you are.</p>
        <p>From traditional bridal sets to contemporary everyday pieces, our designs bridge heritage and modernity, ensuring every woman finds something that speaks to her soul.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section reverse">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/images/products/necklace-gold-traditional-1.jpeg" alt="Handcrafted Jewelry">
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>At Jewels by Iram, our mission is to make luxury accessible. We are committed to delivering exceptional quality jewelry at prices that make you smile, without ever compromising on craftsmanship or materials.</p>
        <p>We envision a world where every woman can own a piece of fine jewelry that she treasures for a lifetime and passes down through generations. Every ring, necklace, and earring is a promise of enduring beauty.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Values -->
<section class="section" style="background: var(--color-white);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <p>The principles that guide everything we do</p>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-card-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-gem"></i>
        </div>
        <h4>Quality</h4>
        <p>We use only the finest materials and maintain rigorous quality standards to ensure every piece meets our exacting standards of excellence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-card-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-hands"></i>
        </div>
        <h4>Craftsmanship</h4>
        <p>Our artisans bring decades of experience and skill to every creation, blending traditional techniques with contemporary design sensibilities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-card-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
        </div>
        <h4>Trust</h4>
        <p>We believe in transparency and integrity. Every piece comes with authenticity certificates and our commitment to your complete satisfaction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
